      "content": "i know there are people who care but it doesn't change the reality of it. it's like no matter what i do, i'm just stuck in this cycle and i'm the one causing the problem for everyone. it's just so exhausting to keep trying when it feels like the end result is always going to be the same. i just want the noise to stop.",
